.SH "Field Documentation"
.PP 
.SS "int p8est_inspect::use_balance_ranges"

.PP
Use sc_ranges to determine the asymmetric communication pattern\&. If \fIuse_balance_ranges\fP is false (the default), sc_notify is used\&. 
.SS "int p8est_inspect::use_balance_ranges_notify"

.PP
If true, call both sc_ranges and sc_notify and verify consistency\&. Which is actually used is still determined by \fIuse_balance_ranges\fP\&. 

